<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@/~cl_11> <https://schema.org/text> "Paragraph 11(1 )(c) of the principal Act is amended by deleting the words \"with the concurrence of the Minister of Finance\". Amendment of section 16c"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@/~cl_12> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> .
