<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@/~cl_12> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 16c(l) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: \"(b) not less than five other members to be appointed by the Minister from amongst persons who are members of or who have held office in the Judicial and Legal Service or advocates and solicitors admitted and enrolled under the Legal Profession Act 1976 [Act 166], the Advocates Ordinance of Sabah [Sabah Cap. 2] or the Advocates Ordinance of Sarawak [Sarawak Cap. 110] and who have not less than seven years' standing.\". Amendment of section 16E"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@/~cl_13> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> .
