<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@/~cl_13> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 16E of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (d) the following paragraph: \"(d) upon the member ceasing to be an advocate and solicitor under the Legal Profession Act 1976, the Advocates Ordinance of Sabah or the Advocates Ordinance of Sarawak.\". Amendment of section 16M"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> .
