<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 2 of the principal Act is amended —"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> .
