<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@/~cl_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2A) The Minister may at any time by order published in the Gazette, revoke any exemption granted by him under subsection (2).\". Amendment of section 3"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/48/eng@> .
